        'MERGE MID$ MKDIR MKD$ MKI$ MKS$ MOD NAME NEW NEXT NOISE NOT OCT$ ON OR PEN PLAY STRIG OPEN OPTION ' +
        'BASE OUT PAINT PALETTE PCOPY PEEK PMAP POINT POKE POS PRINT PRINT] PSET PRESET ' +
