        'RUN SAVE SCREEN SGN SHELL SIN SOUND SPACE$ SPC SQR STEP STICK STOP STR$ STRING$ SWAP ' +
        'SYSTEM TAB TAN TIME$ TIMER TROFF TRON TO USR VAL VARPTR VARPTR$ VIEW WAIT WHILE ' +
